# The value in one breath: an agent is at work, ⌃⌥⌘A turns awake on, the lid
# closes, time passes, and the work is further along when it opens.
clock 22:40 · battery 76 · floor 15
agent claude ~/billing
agent history "Migrate billing to the v2 API and run the whole test suite."
agent work "Migrating billing to the v2 API"
caption "Claude Code is migrating billing. It needs hours."

key
caption "Press ⌃⌥⌘A: the cup fills, awake is on."
lid close
time +1h50m · battery 58
caption "Close the lid. The Mac stays awake."
agent tool Update "src/billing/client.ts" "Updated src/billing/client.ts with 212 additions and 98 removals"
agent tool Update "src/billing/invoices.ts" "Updated src/billing/invoices.ts with 64 additions and 41 removals"
agent tool Bash "npm test" "1,284 passed, 0 failed"
lid open
caption "Open it 1h 50m later: migrated, 1,284 tests pass."
